{"app":"spr-flow","version":3,"nodes":[{"id":"note","type":"info","position":{"x":-806,"y":-496},"data":{"title":"Narrow band-pass filter (three cavities, 532 nm)","text":"Specification: T ≥ 90 % on 531.5–532.5 nm (a flat top 1 nm wide), OD ≥ 3 on 500–528 and 536–565 nm; TiO₂ / SiO₂ on BK7.\n\nThe cavity trick: a half-wave spacer (HH) between two quarter-wave mirrors opens a narrow transmission line (Fabry-Pérot); a single cavity is peaked (FWHM 1.6 nm with (HL)^5), cavities coupled by a quarter-wave L give a flat top and steep edges (Macleod).\n\nStart: (HL)^5 HH (LH)^5 L (HL)^5 HH (LH)^5 L (HL)^5 HH (LH)^5 at 532 nm (68 layers): the line is at 531.3 nm with ripple on the top. Press Start (deep search) to centre and flatten it.","color":"#8a93a6","width":380,"height":330}},{"id":"air","type":"material","position":{"x":-806,"y":24},"data":{"materialId":"Air","color":"#f4f6fa","indexMode":"absolute","porosity":{"$num":"NaN"}}},{"id":"tio2","type":"material","position":{"x":-806,"y":236},"data":{"materialId":"TiO2","color":"#f2f0e6","indexMode":"absolute","porosity":{"$num":"NaN"}}},{"id":"sio2","type":"material","position":{"x":-806,"y":448},"data":{"materialId":"SiO2","color":"#cfe3ef","indexMode":"absolute","porosity":{"$num":"NaN"}}},{"id":"bk7","type":"material","position":{"x":-806,"y":661},"data":{"materialId":"BK7","color":"#9fc9e6","indexMode":"absolute","porosity":{"$num":"NaN"}}},{"id":"filter","type":"filter","position":{"x":-364,"y":-71},"data":{"name":"Band-pass 532 nm","preset":"custom","bands":[{"lo":500,"hi":528,"q":"OD","kind":"ge","value":3,"tol":0.1,"weight":1},{"lo":531.5,"hi":532.5,"q":"T","kind":"ge","value":0.9,"tol":0.01,"weight":2},{"lo":536,"hi":565,"q":"OD","kind":"ge","value":3,"tol":0.1,"weight":1}],"lmin":500,"lmax":565,"step":0.1,"targetQ":"T","angles":"0","pol":"s","materials":2,"thick":false,"dSub":1,"sides":"front","minD":5,"maxD":2000,"maxLayers":100,"maxTotal":20000,"algorithm":"deep","iterations":10,"needleStep":10,"lambdaRef":532